      "message": "We\u0027ve already got some examples of package lists that exceed the character limit on debug properties, so I think you\u0027ll need to expand this to:\n```\nsetprop debug.angle.allowlist\nsetprop debug.angle.allowlist.1\nsetprop debug.angle.allowlist.2\netc...\n```\n\nThis is how the vulkan loader handles it:\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:frameworks/native/vulkan/libvulkan/api.cpp;l\u003d188;drc\u003d8ef2a261136c267bc941952190f32d9e72c3bf4c\n\nHere is the debug property limit (92):\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:bionic/libc/include/sys/system_properties.h;l\u003d41;drc\u003d8ef2a261136c267bc941952190f32d9e72c3bf4c;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1",
      "range": {
